<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <title>Noah Humbert</title>
        {% include 'partials/_head.html.twig' %}
    </head>

    <body>
        <!-- Top Navitation Bar-->
        {% include 'partials/_navbar.html.twig' %}

        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="container mt-2 mb-2 text-center">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-12">
                    <p class="fs-1 my-0">Mentorship Program</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Top Screen Schedule button -->
        <div class="row mt-1 justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-lg-2 col-6 d-grid gap-2">
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://calendar.app.google/nyvMuGC8DBSDuFK3A">Book a Free Call</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!--  / Why Listen to me? -->
        <div class="container my-5">
            <div class="row justify-content-center mb-2">
                <div class="col-4 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="card" style="max-width: auto;">
                        <div class="row g-0">
                            <div class="col-md-12">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h5 class="fs-2 mb-4 text-center">Why listen to me?</h5>
                                    <p class="fs-6">
                                        At 18, as a 4.2 GPA student at the top of my class, I made the decision to carve my own path instead of following the traditional college route. I started working full-time on an IT help desk, where I've helped implement and improve hundreds of business-critical processes. Along the way, I purchased my first home at 19 years old.

                                        To me, owning a home isn't just about having a place to live—it's about building long-term financial stability and investing in an asset that can grow over time. I didn't achieve these milestones through luck or shortcuts. They came from discipline, intentional decisions, and a willingness to keep learning. If you're willing to put in that same effort, I'll help you build a plan to do the same.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-4 col-lg-4">
                    <img src=" {{ asset('images/noah.png') }} " class="card-img-top" alt="Noah">
                </div>
                <div class="col-4 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="card" style="max-width: auto;">
                        <div class="row g-0">
                            <div class="col-md-12">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h5 class="fs-2 mb-4 text-center">Who It's For?</h5>
                                    <p class="fs-6">
                                        This mentorship program is designed for young adults who want more direction, stronger discipline, and a solid financial foundation. This is not a get-rich-quick program. It's practical mentorship focused on helping you develop the mindset, habits, and skills needed to create long-term success on your own terms.

                                        If you're ready to take ownership of your future and consistently put in the work, this program will give you the guidance, accountability, and roadmap to help you get there.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>